  "Specification": "This specification models a simple message-delivery system with two roles: a sender and a receiver. The sender assigns increasing sequence numbers to messages and records which messages have been sent, while the receiver may receive any subset of sent-but-not-yet-received messages out of order. The receiver delivers messages to the client only in sequence order, and the invariant asserts that any nonnegative delivered sequence number must already belong to the set of sent messages.",
